  <abstract format="text/plain" language="en" script="Latn">Recommendation ITU-T Y.1221 provides a general description as well as objectives and procedures for traffic control and congestion control for IP-based networks. In particular, it describes the concepts of the traffic contract between a user and the network. It specifies the IP transfer capabilities (IPTCs) including, for each IPTC, the service model, the associated traffic patterns and conformance definition.</abstract>
